e de Dečani</value></Data><Data name="name:ru"><value>Дечанский храм</value></Data><Data name="name:sr"><value>Дечанска црква</value></Data><Data name="name:sr-Latn"><value>Dečanska crkva</value></Data><Data name="religion"><value>christian</value></Data><Data name="@geometry"><value>center</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>20.2664093,42.547052</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Gjimnazi Kuvendi i Junikut</name><ExtendedData><Data name="@id"><value>way/223993509</value></Data><Data name="addr:city"><value>junik</value></Data><Data name="amenity"><value>school</value></Data><Data name="name"><value>Gjimnazi Kuvendi i Junikut</value></Data><Data name="@geometry"><value>center</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>20.2715257,42.4841699</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>AMF Novosella Eperme</name><ExtendedData><Data name="@id"><value>way/223993511</value></Data><Data name="addr:city"><value>Novoselle e Eperme</value></Data><Data name="addr:street"><value>Gjergj Kastrioti</value></Data><Data name="amenity"><value>hospital</value></Data><Data name="building"><value>yes</value></Data><Data name="emergency"><value>yes</value></Data><Data name="healthcare"><value>hospital</value></Data><Data name="name"><value>AMF Novosella Eperme</value></Data><Data name="@geometry"><value>center</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>20.3928929,42.4624523</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>SHFMU &quot;Shtjefën Kurti&quot;</name><ExtendedData><Data name="@id"><value>way/223993513</value></Data><Data name="amenity"><value>school</value></Data><Data name="building"><value>yes</value></Data><Data name="name"><value>SHFMU &quot;Shtjefën Kurti&quot;</value></Data><Data name="@geometry"><value>center</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>20.3928177,42.4614393</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>ТЦ Нови Београд</name><ExtendedData><Data name="@id"><value>way/224848176</value></Data><Data name